###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The data sets are taken from other works (the paper marks them with URLs); their reference calculations are not restated, so the data-set nodes carry no mlips:ReferenceCalculation. That each set includes stresses is assumed from the stress MAEs reported for four of them. Whether the MAEs are on validation or test splits is not said in the text read.
# - Errors for the alloy, cathode, perovskite and semiconductor models are shown only in Fig. 3 (RMSE against GemNet-OC, EquiformerV2, NequIP, Allegro and DPA-2 values from the DPA-2 paper). Parameter counts differ slightly between the main text and the Methods (cathode 2,130 vs 2,066; perovskite 6,092 vs 6,028); the Methods values are encoded.
# - Fine-tuned per-compound half-Heusler models (Table S3), phonon and thermal-transport results and other applications are not encoded. Preprint only.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
